    "verifyAgainstManual": true,
    "notes": "Physical field geometry is generated from official STEP (cadManifest), with embedded CAD scoring elements and alliance-area hardware removed from the static visual. The tile playing surface is z=0. Scoring volumes, zones, and triggers remain explicit preset data but their centers are registered to the official CAD. Raw STEP stays in var/cad/ (gitignored). Runtime MuJoCo loads cadManifest convex parts (not field.glb or schematic AABBs); field_mjcf.xml is the assembled MJCF. CAD collision is convex assembly parts, never one concave field mesh. VERIFY: tip threshold is scoring-side; AprilTag IDs 1–3, 4–6, 42–45 are inferred (manual extract only confirmed 0, 7, 38–41). POLLEN diameter 2.8 in per §9.8. Official field ~144 x 144 in inside perimeter. CAD general tolerance +/- 1 in."
  },
