    "yIncreases": "away_from_red_wall",
    "headingPositive": "ccw",
    "notes": "Red half is x<0; audience wall is y=-72. Red ALLIANCE AREA is audience-left. AUTO sides are tile columns A–C (red) / D–E–F (blue)."
